venance": {"model": "gpt-6.1-sol", "effort": "high", "protocol": "PROOF_PROTOCOL", "run": "proof/P009", "date": "2026-10-25"}}, {"id": "6d161339e5c0", "entryId": "dʕr", "kind": "fix-text", "stage": "proofreading", "target": {"stemId": "dʕr.III", "boxId": "dʕr.III.t.preterit", "exampleId": "dʕr.III.t.preterit.8", "field": "turoyo"}, "summary": "Restore the missing l in aʕlayye", "before": "aʕayye", "after": "aʕlayye", "data": {"confidence": "high"}, "rationale": "The supplied 21/86 verse reads \"madʕalle aʕlayye\" (he answered them). The glossary loses the consonant l in this preposition with its plural suffix.", "evidence": [{"textId": "R021", "v": 86, "cite": "21/86"}], "priority": 2, "provenance": {"model": "gpt-6.1-sol", "effort": "high", "protocol": "PROOF_PROTOCOL", "run": "proof/P009", "date": "2026-10-25"}}, {"id": "a668c7740265", "entryId": "dʕr", "kind": "fix-text", "stage": "proofreading", "target": {"stemId": "dʕr.I", "boxId": "dʕr.I.t.infectum", "exampleId": "dʕr.I.t.infectum.5", "field": "translation"}, "summary": "German typo: Gerichtsversammlumg → Gerichtsversammlung", "before": "Gerichtsversammlumg", "after": "Gerichtsversammlung", "data": {"confidence": "high"}, "rationale": "The word is misspelled with m in place of n. The supplied edition translation reads \"Gerichtsversammlung\".", "evidence": [{"textId": "R021", "v": 66, "cite": "21/66"}], "priority": 3, "provenance": {"model": "gpt-6.1-sol", "effort": "high", "protocol": "PROOF_PROTOCOL", "run": "proof/P009", "date": "2026-10-25"}}, {"id": "4d7243d33078", "entryId": "dʕr", "kind": "fix-text", "stage": "proofreading", "target": {"stemId": "dʕr.I", "boxId": "dʕr.I.t.infectum-wa", "exampleId": "dʕr.I.t.infectum-wa.3", "field": "translation"}, "summary": "German typo: Warfspießen → Wurfspießen", "before": "Warfspießen", "after": "Wurfspießen", "data": {"confidence": "high"}, "rationale": "The weapons called ǧaridat in this example are throwing spears, German Wurfspieße (dative plural Wurfspießen). 